        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For the physical assets that are increasingly embedded with cloud connectivity, we work with original equipment manufacturers (“OEMs”) and other partners to capture data via application programming interfaces (“APIs”) or other connection methods.",
